<title>USA: Spa Faucet sets 3-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Spa Faucet sets 3-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spa Faucet Inc said Thursday its board has approved a three-for-one stock split, payable October 31 to shareholders of record on October 15.</p>
<p>Separately, the company said it was chosen as a supplier to Lowe's Companies Inc's faucet import program.</p>
<p>In 1995, that program generated over $15 million in sales, Spa Faucet said.</p>
</text>
